<title>BELGIUM: W.EUROPE CAR REGISTRATIONS UP 6.5 PCT IN DEC.</title>
<headline>W.EUROPE CAR REGISTRATIONS UP 6.5 PCT IN DEC.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Automobile</p>
<p>Manufacturers Association (ACEA) released the following</p>
<p>provisional West European new car registrations figures for</p>
<p>December.</p>
<p> Dec 96			 Dec 95			pct change</p>
<p> 774,300			727,300		     +6.5</p>
<p> Jan-Dec 96		   Jan-Dec 95</p>
<p> 12,803,700		   12,026,900		  +6.5</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
